 e7b41cb81a714e1d9fdd57/1775079429724-LR9GYG12UIN70UZYUQJ3/HOTA+Eventbrite+
 banner_Swing+Night-GENERIC.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the first Sunday of every month for SUNDAY SWING NI
 GHT at Hall of the Above 🎷 Featuring a new-to-HOTA band\, The doRiaN Mo
 de! 🎷 The doRiaN Mode explores the Great American Songbook as it dishes
  up vintage jazz\, swinging R&amp\;B\, and soulful ballads\, from the soun
 ds of 1920s speakeasies and 1930s big-band swing to 1940s jump blues and t
 he rollicking R&amp\;B of Ruth Brown. Vocalist and bassist Dorian Bartley&
 nbsp\;leads this Petaluma-based acoustic quartet featuring Robby Elfman on
  piano/clarinet\, Peter Graves on sax\, and Tony Blake on drums.&nbsp\;Whe
 ther they’re stomping at the Savoy in salute to Count Basie or paying ho
 mage to R&amp\;B legend Etta James\, the doRiaN Mode brings elegance to cl
 assic American music. 💃🏻 Jasmine Worrell\, the Bay Area’s top swin
 g dance instructor\, will offer a class from 4:15 – 5:00 👯 Followed b
 y live music and an open dance floor until 7:00 PM 🎟️ $25 for admissi
 on includes the class — cash at the door. Kids 12 and under are free. 
 🕺🏾 All skill levels welcome\; no partner required. See you on the da
 nce floor! #block-4fe0cb7564f6a0fb12b2 { --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0p
